# Trivy Image Scan Suppressions
# Last triaged: 2026-07-24
#
# All entries below are CVEs found in the Docker base image (node:22-slim)
# and its bundled tooling (npm, corepack, lefthook). They are not in
# application code and are not exploitable at runtime:
#
#   - npm/tar: only used during build-time `pnpm install`, not at runtime
#   - corepack/pnpm: build-time package manager, not at runtime
#   - lefthook: dev-only Git hook manager, not in production
#   - Debian OS packages: system utilities not exposed to network traffic
#
# Tracked for remediation in Phase 7.5 (Docker production image hardening):
# multi-stage build to strip build tools from the final image.
#
# Alpine is not an option because sodium-native has no musl prebuilds.

